{"seq":3,"slug":"variation-evolution","title":"高三生物 — 变异与进化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/genetics-review/variation-evolution","wordCount":2000,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三生物-变异与进化\">高三生物 — 变异与进化</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>变异与进化是遗传学的延伸，将个体层面的遗传现象拓展到群体和物种层面。高考中这部分内容以选择题和简答题交替出现，核心考点包括基因突变和基因重组的区别、染色体变异的类型、现代生物进化理论的核心观点。</p>\n<p>变异类型的分类体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变异类型</th>\n<th>本质</th>\n<th>可遗传性</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基因突变</td>\n<td>DNA 碱基对的增添、缺失或替换</td>\n<td>可遗传</td>\n<td>镰刀型细胞贫血症</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基因重组</td>\n<td>基因的重新组合</td>\n<td>可遗传</td>\n<td>自由组合、交叉互换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>染色体变异</td>\n<td>染色体结构或数目改变</td>\n<td>可遗传</td>\n<td>21 三体综合征、多倍体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可遗传变异</td>\n<td>环境引起的表现型改变</td>\n<td>不可遗传</td>\n<td>水肥充足使植株高大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-基因突变\">一、基因突变</h3><p><strong>基因突变的概念</strong>：基因中碱基对的增添、缺失或替换导致基因结构的改变。</p>\n<p><strong>基因突变的特点</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>具体说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普遍性</td>\n<td>一切生物都可以发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机性</td>\n<td>可以发生在任何时期、任何个体、任何基因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不定向性</td>\n<td>一个基因可以突变为多种等位基因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低频性</td>\n<td>自然状态下突变频率很低（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多数有害</td>\n<td>大多数突变对生物体不利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>三种碱基对改变的后果比较</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>突变类型</th>\n<th>对蛋白质的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碱基对替换</td>\n<td>影响一个密码子，可能改变一个氨基酸（或不变——密码子简并性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碱基对增添</td>\n<td>从插入位置开始，后面所有密码子的阅读框移位，影响大段蛋白质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碱基对缺失</td>\n<td>从缺失位置开始，后面所有密码子的阅读框移位，影响大段蛋白质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-基因重组\">二、基因重组</h3><p><strong>基因重组的两种类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>发生时期</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自由组合型</td>\n<td>减数第一次分裂后期</td>\n<td>非同源染色体上的非等位基因自由组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉互换型</td>\n<td>减数第一次分裂前期（四分体时期）</td>\n<td>同源染色体的非姐妹染色单体交叉互换片段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>基因重组的意义</strong>：是有性生殖后代多样性的主要来源，也是生物进化的重要原因之一。</p>\n<p>注意：基因重组只产生新的基因型组合，不产生新的基因。新基因只能通过基因突变产生。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-染色体变异\">三、染色体变异</h3><p><strong>染色体结构变异</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缺失</td>\n<td>染色体丢失一个片段</td>\n<td>猫叫综合征（5 号染色体短臂缺失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复</td>\n<td>染色体增加一个重复片段</td>\n<td>果蝇棒眼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倒位</td>\n<td>染色体某段倒转 180°</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>易位</td>\n<td>两条非同源染色体之间交换片段</td>\n<td>慢性粒细胞白血病</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>染色体数目变异</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>个别染色体增减（非整倍体）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>21 三体综合征（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>47</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n+1=47</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">47</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>染色体组整倍增加（多倍体）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 等</td>\n<td>无子西瓜（三倍体）、小麦（六倍体）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>多倍体的产生</strong>：秋水仙素处理→抑制纺锤体形成→着丝点正常分裂但细胞不分裂→染色体数目加倍。</p>\n<p><strong>单倍体</strong>：体细胞中含有本物种配子染色体数目的个体。单倍体植株矮小瘦弱、高度不育。可通过花药离体培养获得。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-现代生物进化理论\">四、现代生物进化理论</h3><p><strong>种群是进化的基本单位</strong>。种群的基因频率发生改变即为进化。</p>\n<p><strong>核心观点</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基因库</td>\n<td>一个种群中全部个体所含的全部基因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基因频率</td>\n<td>某基因在种群中占全部等位基因的比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基因型频率</td>\n<td>某基因型在种群中占全部个体的比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进化的实质</td>\n<td>种群基因频率的改变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>哈迪-温伯格平衡</strong>（理想条件下）：</p>\n<p>设等位基因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p + q = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AA : Aa : aa = p^2 : 2pq : q^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">pq</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当种群满足：数量足够大、随机交配、无突变、无选择、无迁入迁出时，基因频率不变。这是用来判断种群是否在进化的理论基准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-自然选择与物种形成\">五、自然选择与物种形成</h3><p><strong>自然选择的作用</strong>：自然选择使种群中的有利基因频率升高，不利基因频率降低，导致种群的适应性进化。</p>\n<p><strong>物种形成的一般模式</strong>：</p>\n<p>地理隔离 → 种群间基因不能交流 → 各自在不同方向上进化（自然选择和突变不同）→ 基因频率差异增大 → 生殖隔离 → 新物种形成</p>\n<p><strong>隔离的类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地理隔离</td>\n<td>由地理障碍（河流、山脉等）导致种群分离</td>\n<td>阻止基因交流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生殖隔离</td>\n<td>不同物种间无法成功交配或后代不育</td>\n<td>物种形成的标志</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>共同进化</strong>：不同物种之间、生物与环境之间在相互影响中不断进化和发展。例如猎豹与羚羊的&quot;军备竞赛&quot;——捕食者和被捕食者相互选择，各自速度越来越快。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-基因频率的计算\">六、基因频率的计算</h3><p><strong>根据基因型频率计算基因频率</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>总个体数</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(A) = \\frac{2 \\times AA + Aa}{2 \\times \\text{总个体数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总个体数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>总个体数</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(a) = \\frac{2 \\times aa + Aa}{2 \\times \\text{总个体数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总个体数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(a) = 1 - p(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>伴 X 染色体遗传的基因频率计算</strong>：</p>\n<p>女性有两个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>，男性有一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>A</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>A</mi></msup><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>A</mi></msup><mtext>女</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>A</mi></msup><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mtext>女</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>A</mi></msup><mi>Y</mi><mtext>男</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>女性人数</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>男性人数</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(X^A) = \\frac{2 \\times X^AX^A\\text{女} + X^AX^a\\text{女} + X^AY\\text{男}}{2 \\times \\text{女性人数} + \\text{男性人数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2877em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5183em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">女性人数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">男性人数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">女</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">女</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">男</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>区分基因突变、基因重组和染色体变异：果蝇的白眼突变体、唐氏综合征患者、高茎豌豆自交后代出现矮茎，分别属于哪种变异？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某种群有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 个个体，基因型为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span></span></span></span></span> 的有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 个，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 个，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span></span></span></span></span> 的有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 个。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的基因频率。若该种群随机交配一代后，下一代的基因型频率是否改变？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>秋水仙素处理萌发的种子可获得多倍体植株。解释秋水仙素的作用原理，并说明为什么处理的对象是&quot;萌发的种子&quot;而非&quot;干种子&quot;。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么地理隔离不一定导致新物种形成，但生殖隔离一定意味着新物种的产生。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>达尔文的自然选择理论在 1859 年发表时引发了巨大争议。直到 20 世纪 30-40 年代，遗传学和进化生物学的综合——&quot;现代综合进化论&quot;——才为自然选择提供了坚实的遗传学基础。今天的进化生物学已经进入基因组时代，科学家可以比较不同物种的完整基因组序列，精确追踪进化过程中的基因变化。</p>\n<p>人类基因组计划（2003 年完成）揭示了人类基因组中只有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 的 DNA 编码蛋白质，其余大部分曾被称为&quot;垃圾 DNA&quot;，但近年来的研究发现这些区域在基因调控中起着重要作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>变异与进化的复习以三大变异类型（基因突变、基因重组、染色体变异）为基础，以现代生物进化理论为框架。基因突变是新基因的唯一来源，基因重组是有性生殖多样性的主要来源，染色体变异可以改变基因的数目或位置。进化的实质是种群基因频率的改变，自然选择是方向性驱动力，地理隔离和生殖隔离是物种形成的条件和标志。基因频率的计算是遗传综合题的常考点。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三生物 — 变异与进化","id":"高三生物-变异与进化"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、基因突变","id":"一-基因突变"},{"level":3,"text":"二、基因重组","id":"二-基因重组"},{"level":3,"text":"三、染色体变异","id":"三-染色体变异"},{"level":3,"text":"四、现代生物进化理论","id":"四-现代生物进化理论"},{"level":3,"text":"五、自然选择与物种形成","id":"五-自然选择与物种形成"},{"level":3,"text":"六、基因频率的计算","id":"六-基因频率的计算"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三生物 — 分子遗传","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/genetics-review/molecular-genetics"},"next":{"title":"高三生物 — 生态学综合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/ecology-exam/ecology-review"}}